{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2022-09-26 16:30:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP CHANGES', 'text': 'DALLAS , SEPT. 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV) TODAY IS CELEBRATING THE CONTRIBUTIONS OF PRESIDENT & CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER MIKE VAN DE VEN , AN INDUSTRY VETERAN AND PROVEN LEADER, WHO ANNOUNCED PLANS TO STEP DOWN FROM HIS ROLE AS CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER (COO) AT THE END OF SEPTEMBER AND FROM HIS ROLE AS PRESIDENT AT THE END OF DECEMBER.'}